      {
        "id": "HRV-access-006",
        "statement": "For medicines approved by the EU in 2020-2023, the average time to reimbursement in Croatia was 549 days (EU average 578), and by January 2025 27% of those medicines were covered, against 46% across the EU; the profile notes Croatia gave incomplete survey data.",
        "valence": "weakness",
